  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educate and Feed 25 Orphans Children in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will help build brick walled classrooms to replace the mud walled semi-permanent classrooms currently used by 25 orphans and vulnerable children at the Bukhonzo Samar Children&apos;s Home and school situated in rural Uganda. The project will as well provide free nutritious meals and care for the children from rural villages in Bukhonzo location of Eastern Uganda. Donations towards this project will benefit 25 orphans providing them with meals and a suitable learning environment.</narrative>
  </description>
